From: mscharged-port native integration
Subject: [PATCH] Retain the WorldEffect byte-size assertion only for the Wii ABI
Upstream-base: f1e9646a7da6950143e77b1daed33a92c931a638

Compiler compatibility only. Native declaration layout is measured
separately; no fields, algorithms, serialized stream strides, placement
storage or world readiness are changed. The console assertion remains.

--- a/include/Game/World/WorldEffect.h
+++ b/include/Game/World/WorldEffect.h
@@ -38,7 +38,9 @@
     /* 0x9C */ bool m_bAlwaysVisible;
 };
 
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE)
 typedef char WorldEffect_size_check[sizeof(WorldEffect) == 0xA0 ? 1 : -1];
+#endif
 
 void UpdateAnimatedWorldEffectController(EmissionController& controller);
 void UpdateWorldEffectControllerVisibility(EmissionController& controller);
